  "description": "In this interview, the late Musamoni Panigrahi sings \"Mathā Khaṅkā Bāhunā\" (\"ମଥା ଖଙ୍କା ବାହୁନା\"), a wedding bahuna song in the Baleswari dialect of Odia. Recorded in Balasore, Odisha state, India, by Subhashish Panigrahi in 2014. This footage was a part of the production of his 2022 documentary, Nani Ma but was unused in the film and was edited and published under the ବାଲେସରିଆ (Balesoria) project in 2024-2025. Odia and English subtitles are by Subhashish.",
